		"description": "<p>When you Rage, you shift into a monstrous hybrid form for the duration. While in this form, you gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li>You cannot wield weapons, but you gain natural weapons you're proficient with: a Bite, 1d10 +STR, and Claws, 1d8 +STR.</li><li>+DEX speed and That All You Got?! is now 2xSTR+DEX per Fury Die spent.</li></ul><hr><p><em>[A] Grants the Bite (1d10+STR) and Claws (1d8+STR) natural weapons. While you Rage (or are in Beast Form) your speed is +DEX and That all you got?! reduces by 2×STR+DEX per die.</em></p><p><em>[A] Attacking with a weapon while Raging, or with a natural weapon while neither Raging nor in Beast Form, posts a reminder — it is never blocked.</em></p>",
